CALE builds on the public FRACAL and MMDetection implementations.

FRACAL: https://github.com/kostas1515/FRACAL
MMDetection: https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmdetection
APA / AGLU: https://github.com/kostas1515/AGLU

The mmdet directory includes detector implementations and modifications from
these projects. Existing copyright and license notices are retained. The cale
directory, inference configurations, and tools provide the CALE release's
score adjustment, prior estimation, and evaluation interface.

Datasets and model checkpoints are distributed by their original providers.
